# .trivyignore
# CVEs accepted and excluded from Trivy scan failure.
# Format: one CVE ID per line, with optional expiry date and comment.
#
# Before accepting a CVE, document:
#   1. WHY it is not exploitable in this context
#   2. An expiry date — reviewed CVEs should be re-evaluated regularly
#   3. The ticket/issue tracking the decision
#
# Example:
#   # CVE-2023-XXXXX: Affects feature X which we don't use (TICKET-123)
#   # exp:2026-12-31
#   CVE-2023-XXXXX
#
# Current accepted exceptions: none
# All HIGH and CRITICAL findings must be fixed or explicitly accepted here.
